# WHAT MUST NOT BE PUBLISHED TO abyquotes.com
#
# 2026-08-21. `wrangler.jsonc` sets the static-asset directory to "." -- the whole repo -- so every
# file here was being uploaded and SERVED PUBLICLY. Measured live before this file existed:
#
#   /.dev.vars        200  <- ADMIN_PASSWORD, SESSION_SECRET and INTEGRATION_TOKEN, in the clear
#   /worker.js        200  325KB, the entire server source
#   /.git/config      200
#   /.git/index       200
#   /.git/objects/..  200  <- the whole repository, cloneable, including deleted history
#   /schema.sql       200
#
# This file works like .gitignore and is read by wrangler at deploy time.
#
# RULES FOR EDITING IT:
#   - Adding a pattern REMOVES a file from the public site. Safe direction.
#   - Removing one PUBLISHES that file. Never do it to make something work without checking what
#     else the pattern was holding back.
#   - It only takes effect on `npx wrangler deploy`. Nothing here is enforced by a push.
#
# The real fix is to move the front-end into its own directory and point `assets.directory` at that,
# so the default becomes "publish nothing" instead of "publish everything". This is the urgent stop.

# --- the repository itself -------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.git/**
.githooks
.githooks/**
.gitignore
.assetsignore

# --- secrets and local state -----------------------------------------------------------------
# .dev.vars is wrangler's LOCAL secret file. It is not supposed to leave the machine.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
.env
.env.*
.wrangler
.wrangler/**

# --- server code -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# worker.js is the worker ENTRY POINT (`main`), not an asset. It does not need to be downloadable
# and publishing it hands over every admin page, every query and every business rule.
worker.js
worker.js.map
wrangler.jsonc
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules
node_modules/**

# --- build, tooling and data -----------------------------------------------------------------
scripts
scripts/**
schema.sql
agencies.txt
README.md
*.md

# NOTE ON WHAT IS DELIBERATELY STILL PUBLISHED:
#   index.html, july-2026.html, aby-logo.png and everything under assets/ are the tool itself.
#   The root-level copies (app.js, pricing.js, renderer.js, reps.js, save-hook.js, utils.js,
#   quote.css) look like older duplicates of files now under assets/, and are LEFT ALONE here on
#   purpose: this change is a security stop, and quietly un-publishing a file the page might still
#   load would turn it into an outage. Work out which are dead and remove them deliberately.
#   reps.js in particular is PUBLIC BY DESIGN -- it is the outside-broker rep list.
